{"id": "TM-10-3930-673-20-1.pdf_p11_chunk_0", "source": "TM-10-3930-673-20-1.pdf", "page": 11, "text": "Change 1 iTECHNICAL MANUAL HEADQUARTERS\nNo. 10-3930-673-20-1 DEPARTMENT OF THE ARMY\nWashington, DC, 4 MAY 1998\nUNIT MAINTENA NCE MANUAL\nFOR\nALL TERRAIN LIFTER ARMY SYSTEM (ATLAS)\n10,000 LB CAPACITY\nNSN 3930-01-417-2886\nTABLE OF CONTENTS\nPage\nHOW TO USE THIS MANUAL  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . iv\nCHAPTER 1 INTRODUCTION  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 1-1\nSection I. General Information . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 1-1\nSection II. Equipment Description . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 1-3\nSection III.", "snippet": "Change 1 iTECHNICAL MANUAL HEADQUARTERS\nNo. 10-3930-673-20-1 DEPARTMENT OF THE ARMY\nWashington, DC, 4 MAY 1998\nUNIT MAINTENA NCE MANUAL\nFOR\nALL TERRAIN LIFTER ARMY SYSTEM (ATLAS)\n10,000 LB CAPACITY\nNS"}
