{"id": "TM-10-3930-673-20-1.pdf_p124_chunk_0", "source": "TM-10-3930-673-20-1.pdf", "page": 124, "text": "TM 10-3930-673-20-1\n2-723. BACK-UP ALARM DOES NOT OPERATE (CONT). KNOWN INFO\nBack-up alarm OK. Connector J1 OK. Connector P1 OK.Wire 21 OK. Back-up switch OK. Wire 20 OK.Circuit breaker CB2 OK. Wire 5 OK. Relay K2 OK. POSSIBLE PROBLEMS\nWire 3 faulty. Run relay K1 faulty. Wire 1 faulty.Circuit breaker CB6 faulty. Wire 9 faulty. Connector J2 faulty.Connector P2 faulty.TEST OPTIONS\nVoltage test. STE/ICE-R 89. REASON FOR QUESTION\nIf 24 vdc is present, wire 3 faulty. KNOWN INFO\nBack-up alarm OK. Connector J1 OK. Connector P1 OK. Wire 21 OK.Back-up switch OK. Wire 20 OK. Circuit breaker CB2 OK.Wire 5 OK. Relay K2 OK. Wire 3 OK. POSSIBLE PROBLEMS\nRun relay K1 faulty. Wire 1 faulty. Circuit breaker CB6 faulty.Wire 9 faulty. Connector J2 faulty.", "snippet": "TM 10-3930-673-20-1\n2-723. BACK-UP ALARM DOES NOT OPERATE (CONT). KNOWN INFO\nBack-up alarm OK. Connector J1 OK. Connector P1 OK.Wire 21 OK. Back-up switch OK. Wire 20 OK.Circuit breaker CB2 OK. Wire 5"}
{"id": "TM-10-3930-673-20-1.pdf_p124_chunk_1", "source": "TM-10-3930-673-20-1.pdf", "page": 124, "text": "up switch OK. Wire 20 OK. Circuit breaker CB2 OK.Wire 5 OK. Relay K2 OK. Wire 3 OK. POSSIBLE PROBLEMS\nRun relay K1 faulty. Wire 1 faulty. Circuit breaker CB6 faulty.Wire 9 faulty. Connector J2 faulty.\nConnector P2 faulty.TEST OPTIONS\nVoltage test.STE/ICE-R 89. REASON FOR QUESTION\nIf 24 vdc is present, relay K1 faulty.8\nIs 24 vdc present at relay K1 \n(run relay) where wire 3 \nconnects? YESNOGo to Step 9 of this \nfault. 9\nIs 24 vdc present at relay K1 \nwhere wire 1 connects? YESNOGo to Step 10 of \nthis fault. Replace relay K1 (Para 8-23).Repair wire 3 (Para 8-48).", "snippet": "up switch OK. Wire 20 OK. Circuit breaker CB2 OK.Wire 5 OK. Relay K2 OK. Wire 3 OK. POSSIBLE PROBLEMS\nRun relay K1 faulty. Wire 1 faulty. Circuit breaker CB6 faulty.Wire 9 faulty. Connector J2 faulty."}
