{"id": "TM-10-3930-673-20-1.pdf_p308_chunk_1", "source": "TM-10-3930-673-20-1.pdf", "page": 308, "text": " OK. Wire 1 OK. Run relay K1 OK.Wire 3 OK. Relay K2 OK. Wire 5 OK. POSSIBLE PROBLEMS\nCircuit breaker CB7 faulty. Wire 70 faulty. Front floodlight switch faulty.TEST OPTIONS\nVoltage test.STE/ICE-R #89.\nREASON FOR QUESTION\nIf voltage is not present, circuit \nbreaker CB7 is faulty.12\nIs 24 vdc present at circuit \nbreaker CB7 where wire 5 \nconnects? YESNORepair wire 5\n(Para 8-48). 13\nIs 24 vdc present at circuit \nbreaker CB7 where wire 70 \nconnects? YESNOReplace circuit \nbreaker CB7\n(Para 8-11).", "snippet": " OK. Wire 1 OK. Run relay K1 OK.Wire 3 OK. Relay K2 OK. Wire 5 OK. POSSIBLE PROBLEMS\nCircuit breaker CB7 faulty. Wire 70 faulty. Front floodlight switch faulty.TEST OPTIONS\nVoltage test.STE/ICE-R #89."}
