{"id": "TM-10-3930-673-20-1.pdf_p435_chunk_0", "source": "TM-10-3930-673-20-1.pdf", "page": 435, "text": "TM 10-3930-673-20-1\n2-383LOW BRAKE\nPRESSURE\nINDICATORLOW BRAKE\nPRESSUREINDICATORSOCKETWIRE 10 WIRE 11\nPANELSCREWWIRE 11BRAKE\nPRESSURE\nHYDRAULIC\nSWITCHBRAKE HYDRAULIC PRESSURE \nSWITCH TEST\nRefer to Paragraph 8-17.\nCONTINUITY CHECK\n(1) Connect multimeter positive lead (+) to \nwire 11 at brake hydraulic pressure \nswitch.\n(2) Connect multimeter negative lead (–) to \nwire 11 at low brake pressure indicator light.(a) If continuity is not present, replace \nwire 11 (Para 8-48).\n(b) If continuity is present, go to Step 6 \nof this fault.\nTR01613", "snippet": "TM 10-3930-673-20-1\n2-383LOW BRAKE\nPRESSURE\nINDICATORLOW BRAKE\nPRESSUREINDICATORSOCKETWIRE 10 WIRE 11\nPANELSCREWWIRE 11BRAKE\nPRESSURE\nHYDRAULIC\nSWITCHBRAKE HYDRAULIC PRESSURE \nSWITCH TEST\nRefer to Par"}
