{"id": "TM-10-3930-673-20-1.pdf_p636_chunk_1", "source": "TM-10-3930-673-20-1.pdf", "page": 636, "text": "g switch OK. POSSIBLE PROBLEMS\nConnector J1 faulty. Connector P1 faulty. Wire 92 faulty. Emergency steering relay faulty.Emergency steering solenoid \nfaulty.TEST OPTIONS\nContinuity test.STE/ICE-R #91.\nREASON FOR QUESTION\nIf continuity is not present, \nconnector P1 or wire 92 is faulty.10\nIs continuity present on \nwire 92 between emergency \nsteering switch and connector J1-21? YESNORepair wire 92 \nand/or connector \nJ1 (Para 8-48). 11\nIs continuity present on wire \n92 between emergency \nsteering solenoid and connector P1-21? YESNORepair wire 92 \nand/or connector \nP1 (Para 8-49).", "snippet": "g switch OK. POSSIBLE PROBLEMS\nConnector J1 faulty. Connector P1 faulty. Wire 92 faulty. Emergency steering relay faulty.Emergency steering solenoid \nfaulty.TEST OPTIONS\nContinuity test.STE/ICE-R #91."}
